.TH DICTADESK 1 "November 2026" "DictaDesk 1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dictadesk \- Desktop Dictation for Linux
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dictadesk
.RI [ --background ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
DictaDesk provides local or explicitly selected remote speech transcription,
configurable desktop shortcuts and a notification-area icon.
Local Parakeet transcription is the default; download a model in Preferences.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --background
Start in the notification area without opening the main window.
If a tray host is unavailable, show the window so the application remains reachable.
.SH SHORTCUTS
Super+V starts dictation and inserts text at pauses. Press again or Escape to finish.
Super+Shift+V starts continuous dictation. Shortcuts can be changed in Preferences.
Global shortcuts and automatic insertion require X11.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/dictadesk/preferences.json
User preferences; XDG_CONFIG_HOME is respected.
.TP
.I /var/cache/dictadesk/<uid>
Private per-user model cache for the Debian installation.
Package removal deletes this cache; upgrades preserve it.
.SH PRIVACY
Local transcription processes audio on this computer after model download.
Remote mode sends audio to OpenAI and may incur API charges.
